&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We look for people who are intensely curious and hold themselves to a high bar. Our ambition is significant, and achieving it requires a team that operates at the highest level. We seek individuals who embody our core traits:&lt;strong&gt; Scrappy, Curious, Optimistic, Persistent, and Empathetic&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As an AI Transformation Analyst (P3), you will serve as a strategic partner to Dialpad&#39;s business units, identifying and leveraging AI tools, processes, and agents to significantly improve employee productivity, reduce operational costs, and drive net new ARR. You will be responsible for the end-to-end success of these initiatives, from initial discovery and solution architecture to measuring long-term business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In this role, you will design and architect high-impact solutions, collaborating closely with AI Transformation Engineers for technical deployment while maintaining a relentless focus on tracking adoption metrics and quantifying productivity gains.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role is based in Argentina and reports to the Senior Manager, AI Transformation. The candidate should maintain overlap with North American and global teams to support cross-functional collaboration and project delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
