&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Submit papers to top-tier academic conferences and journals and contribute to the broader scientific community by reviewing submissions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
