&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We look for people who are intensely curious and hold themselves to a high bar. Our ambition is significant, and achieving it requires a team that operates at the highest level. We seek individuals who embody our core traits:&lt;strong&gt; Scrappy, Curious, Optimistic, Persistent, and Empathetic&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Dialpad is redefining business communications through agentic AI, and this role sits at the center of that transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reporting directly to the Chief Revenue Officer, the Vice President of AI Transformation will build and lead Dialpad&#39;s global specialist sales organization responsible for driving adoption and revenue growth of our agentic product portfolio. You will define the strategy, operating model, and execution framework that enables our core sales organization to successfully position, sell, and expand agentic AI solutions across new and existing customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This is both a strategic and hands-on leadership role. You&#39;ll recruit and develop a world-class overlay team, partner closely with Sales, Customer Success, Product, Marketing, and Engineering, and serve as the executive voice of the field as we bring new AI innovations to market. Success requires equal parts sales leadership, product curiosity, operational excellence, and a passion for helping customers transform how work gets done through AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build, lead, and scale Dialpad&#39;s global Agentic Sales Overlay organization, including hiring, coaching, and developing high-performing specialist sales leaders and Agentic Transformation Advisors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Define and execute the global go-to-market strategy for Dialpad&#39;s agentic product portfolio, partnering closely with Sales leadership to maximize adoption and revenue growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Establish the operating cadence, sales methodology, forecasting process, and performance metrics for the overlay organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner directly with frontline sales leaders and Account Executives on strategic opportunities, executive customer engagements, and complex enterprise deals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop repeatable sales plays, qualification frameworks, positioning, and messaging that enable consistent execution across global sales teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Drive pipeline generation, opportunity acceleration, expansion strategy, and revenue attainment for the agentic business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Serve as the executive liaison between the field and Product, Product Marketing, Engineering, and Customer Success, translating customer feedback into product and go-to-market improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Analyze pipeline health, conversion metrics, competitive trends, product adoption, and revenue performance to identify opportunities and improve execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build enablement programs that increase seller confidence and proficiency in positioning and selling agentic AI solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with executive leadership on investment planning, organizational design, territory strategy, resource allocation, and business planning for the agentic business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Champion a culture of experimentation, continuous learning, and AI-first selling practices across the revenue organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Represent Dialpad with executive customer stakeholders, strategic partners, and industry events as a thought leader in agentic AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
