&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;10+ years of enterprise SaaS sales experience, with significant experience leading high-performing sales organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years leading managers and/or specialist overlay organizations in complex enterprise environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
