&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Solid grasp of AI evaluation: how to measure whether a system does what it&#39;s supposed to do, and how to build feedback loops that drive continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
