&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting webinars, virtual events, field marketing programs, or in-person events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Exposure to account-based marketing concepts and sales-aligned marketing execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
