&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We look for people who are intensely curious and hold themselves to a high bar. Our ambition is significant, and achieving it requires a team that operates at the highest level. We seek individuals who embody our core traits:&lt;strong&gt; Scrappy, Curious, Optimistic, Persistent, and Empathetic&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Field Marketing &amp;amp; Events Specialist to support the planning, execution, and measurement of webinars, account-based marketing initiatives, field programs, and in-person events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This execution-focused role will primarily support webinar and ABM program delivery in partnership with the Field Programs &amp;amp; ABM Manager, while also providing coordination and administrative support to the broader regional marketing team. The position will report to the Head of Global Marketing Events and contribute to events and broader marketing initiatives as priorities require.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with Marketing, Sales—including Account Executives and SDRs—and other cross-functional partners to create well-coordinated, engaging programs that help generate pipeline, deepen customer relationships, support account priorities, and advance go-to-market goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate is highly organized, proactive, detail-oriented, and comfortable managing multiple projects, stakeholders, and deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
