&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Being a Dialer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Dialpad, AI isn’t just a feature; it’s how our teams do their best work every day. We put powerful AI tools in every employee’s hands so they can move faster, think bigger, and achieve more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe every conversation matters. And we’ve built the platform that turns those conversations into insight and action, for our customers and ourselves.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We look for people who are intensely curious and hold themselves to a high bar. Our ambition is significant, and achieving it requires a team that operates at the highest level. We seek individuals who embody our core traits:&lt;strong&gt; Scrappy, Curious, Optimistic, Persistent, and Empathetic&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Sr. Salesforce Developer, you’ll own the hands-on development of custom solutions on the Salesforce platform. You’ll work closely with Engineers, Systems Analysts, Solutions Architects, and Business Analysts to translate complex business requirements into robust, scalable, and high-quality code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A primary focus of this role will be enhancing and customising our Sales Cloud, CPQ, and Agentforce capabilities to optimise sales and billing operations and deliver AI-powered experiences for internal stakeholders. You’ll also help create a highly reliable, high-performance Salesforce environment that runs at scale, speed, and accuracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll help deliver valuable functionality to our internal customers within an agile environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This position reports to our Sr. Director of Business Applications and has the opportunity to be based in our Bengaluru, India office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end development lifecycle, from design and coding to testing and deployment of high-quality, scalable custom solutions on the Salesforce platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and customize complex solutions within Salesforce Sales Cloud, CPQ, and related revenue operations capabilities to support the entire lead-to-cash lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design and implement AI-powered workflows and experiences leveraging Agentforce, in close partnership with our Business Technology and AI teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Solutions Architects and Business Analysts to translate business requirements into well-architected, secure, and performant technical solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the implementation of complex development projects and integrations with third-party systems across our go-to-market and back-office stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Follow and help evolve development best practices, including code standards, branching strategies, and CI/CD patterns, to ensure maintainable and resilient solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor and provide technical guidance to junior developers, fostering a culture of continuous learning and improvement through rigorous code reviews and constructive feedback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve complex production issues, performing root cause analysis and implementing effective solutions to maintain platform health.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years of hands-on Salesforce development experience, with a proven track record of building custom applications and integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven, in-depth experience with Salesforce Sales Cloud and CPQ is mandatory, as a majority of the development work will be focused in these areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience designing and implementing Agentforce-based solutions to deliver AI-powered experiences, copilots, and automated workflows on Salesforce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Expertise in Apex, SOQL/SOSL, Lightning Web Components (LWC), Aura Components, and Visualforce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with Salesforce APIs (REST, SOAP, Bulk, etc.) and building complex system integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency with modern development tools, including Salesforce DX, VS Code, and version control systems like Git, and CI/CD tools such as Copado or Gearset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience using AI coding assistants, especially Claude Code, to accelerate development while maintaining high standards of code quality, security, and reviewability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of secure coding practices, performance optimization, and scalable solution design on the Salesforce platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salesforce Platform Developer I&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Platform Developer II&lt;/strong&gt; certifications are required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional certifications in &lt;strong&gt;CPQ&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Agentforce Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; are a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Dialpad&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
